  <item>
    <title>12. 日本-中 | 这里の料理，还挺好食の~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dc866cbfd7110df4f84c14</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dc866cbfd7110df4f84c14</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Sep 2024 16:59:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎉欢迎回到馕丁炒肉，品尝百味生活！🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>📕书接上回，这次</span><strong><span>开吃</span></strong><span>！两位在日留子的饮食是怎样的呢？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>没想到，在日一大类饮食就是：面！作为山西人的白天狂喜！蘸面吃到爽！日式拉面也是我们最常见的日本料理，每家都可能不一样！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>🥩还有就是：日式烤肉🔥、烧鸟🥓、寿司🍣、海鲜🐟</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>我们去吃的时候，换了多次篦子让服务员心烦；但是遍地的各种各样的烤肉又让人流口水！而又听说，竟然还有成吉思汗烤羊肉？！而居酒屋的烧鸟配啤酒也是悠哉游哉~蟹肉拌饭真是浇给！肥牛把寿司一顿爆吃，还能吃一些更加神奇的肉......</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>🌊说实话，在国外旅行，去日本确实是可以（短时间内）吃不腻！毕竟也属于......中华料理！</span></p><span></span><p><span>而关于在日本玩什么......且听下回分解！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤主播：地球Global / 韭菜花Chloe / 白天</span></p><span></span><p><span>👨‍👩‍👦嘉宾：旺仔 / 肥牛</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 加入我们：想要了解更多？添加小助手</span><strong><span>VX：ndcr2023</span></strong><span>，加入我们的听友群，一起交流你的旅行故事！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下面深夜放图，警告⚠</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpfCO9Wpuaa2vQhP1YZCxKfSBx6V.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>好吃的烧鸟1</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loOIBFTXJfGqq41Lz3mywuLWTzOb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>好吃的烧鸟2</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnUp2eoA6X1r-iczu-MtEdIxFo0q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>蟹黄盖饭，香的咧！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtzKJtz20938yMD8nBpI2DWWFwu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>滨寿司</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr4_jeig0uLlPLRI9mQKkgfh748G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>蘸面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv3h0D8apC4yNMiSEQ2GlQDB-15l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>怀石料理</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stick Figure - Shine</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucky Kilimanjaro - Burning Friday Night</span></p>]]></description>
