    <guid isPermaLink="false">6643953a82b428eafd9a3015</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>纽西兰下期，旅行走起来！美食吃起来！ 欢迎加入听友群一起畅聊，</span><strong><span>可以添加小助手VX：ndcr2023</span></strong><span>，期待你的关注和反馈！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>大洋洲的新西兰在旅行中赫赫有名，引无数游客驻足！有冰川，湖泊之景色，又有蹦极，跳伞之极限</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>之前的“情绪稳定”机器——</span><strong><span>肥牛加入群聊！</span></strong><span>（没错，又来一个返场的）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>近期新西兰旅游回来的肥牛又发生了什么有趣的故事？除了风景，还有一个神奇的极限运动，还和当地人产生了冲突？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>而在南半球的旅行胜地，嘉宾分享了众多值得观赏的景色，令人心神向往。期待有机会前往旅行！</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家可以在</span><strong><span> 小宇宙 / 喜马拉雅 / 苹果播客Podcast / 网易云音乐 / QQ音乐</span></strong><span> 平台找到我们，求关注订阅点赞评论，地球球球了~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>Global地球 / Chloe韭菜花</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>Oreo / 肥牛（小红书：@肥牛不肥）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提到相关旅行信息：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>皇后镇是新西兰的旅游胜地，拥有各种山川湖泊：塔斯曼冰川、Lake Tekapo 蒂卡波湖、Lake Pukaki 普卡基湖、Lake Wanaka 瓦纳卡湖、奥拉基库克山、孤独的树、奥玛鲁企鹅等，奥克兰也被称为千帆之都。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>提到的美食有：各种牛排、羊肉、三文鱼海胆生蚝等各种海鲜、龙虾薯条、车厘子草莓蓝莓等浆果，Fergburger汉堡等</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>分享给大家一些</span><strong><span>新西兰的照片</span></strong><span>，大家感受一下吧~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fol_tuN4EL92HhvHdzGsQ_pJOpNI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>孤独的树</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgsuU756OWrr0ekqYf5fqTVGt-gC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>湖边的三文鱼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiVgVsMBHV3Bed-V5af87zMhFgQH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>肥牛在冰川</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNdDAs9yhKFwDDdCQzmYM2D8gtl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大汉堡店，Fergburger</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtrUHYCvJjReFxNIKgn3i0qxfJ8a.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>龙虾炸鱼薯条</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrBNLzIKtaNr7QwmQYtjv4FLysJX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>海鸥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljj9xaXI3NSr_iKeRl86wQ_IroXl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>海豹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgNCNkx13jMZyMWBVZa8SLKHeTOo.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>Kiwi bird 奇异鸟（新西兰国宝）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnFLZdT36yZtFOXmVIq1b9FPMxn5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>采摘园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8AvZSD5VPmHaOJGXVQNmFJ42hB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>车厘子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lloVbs5dNdbwHB14XwmlWJBc-Ir3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>纽币（1纽币 = 4.7 人民币左右）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Stick Figure - Shine</span></p><span></span><p><span>Listening for the Weather — Bic Runga（新西兰华裔女歌手）</span></p>]]></description>
