    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年到！2024，馕丁炒肉的第一道菜——送给大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚刚做完工作中的总结，就来回顾一波2023！还是发现有很多值得怀念的事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>简单地分享给大家，希望我们新的一年越来越好，来来来来~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>（希望新年更多听众朋友能关注我们呀~也可以加入群聊，添加V：ndcr2023，开启新的畅聊！）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：Global地球 / Chloe韭菜花 / 白天</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>Catch My Breath</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主要内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 今年病了多少次？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 回顾今年的旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 高速上的“爆胎”令人难忘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 那些我们花的值不值得的钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 2023，我们悟出了什么道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 不喜欢年终总结！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> 家里也搞年终总结，包括狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 几个词总结2023</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 展望未来，送上自己的一句话</span></p>]]></description>
