  <item>
    <title>5. 我爱生气，想想何必！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656758298fb8b597a2054f49</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656758298fb8b597a2054f49</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Nov 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>咱就是说，这几年是不是越来越爱生气啦？一起来聊聊生气或愤怒的那些事吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>生气，这是一种最常见的情绪，充斥在我们周围。每天可能都因为大大小小的事生气：交通太乱，工作太杂，情感太烦，琐事不断。。。当然这可能也是大城市病，有的时候也希望到一个安逸的地方享受呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间长了，生气和愤怒其实都屡见不鲜了。反而有的人，遇到各种事都不生气，心态稳得一皮！你别说啊，这种状态，还挺让人生气的！赶紧听听今天嘉宾的分享！另外，本期嘉宾也带来了不少关于情绪的知识点哦～欢迎学习！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期聊完，我们几位都感觉通透了一些，挖掘了自己的内心，把事情说出来，好像也没什么必要生气，生活还有很多美好值得我们去相遇！也让我们念出那段老诗：</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫生气，莫生气</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生就像一场戏，因为有缘才相聚</span></p><span></span><p><span>相扶到老不容易，是否更该去珍惜</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了小事发脾气，回头想想又何必</span></p><span></span><p><span>别人生气我不气，气出病来无人替</span></p><span></span><p><span>我若生气谁如意，况且伤神又费力</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲朋邻居不要比，儿孙琐事由他去</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃苦享乐在一起，神仙羡慕好伴侣</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>Global地球，韭菜花</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>薇薇，肥牛</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 肥牛下围棋，输了也开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 薇薇的生气无处不在，甚至在电梯、淘宝上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 男生女生的冲动和愤怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 生气了，咋消解？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> “面向对象”的生气法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 地球的“理智暴力”法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 陈年旧事 涌上心头 气的牙痒痒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 以前是因为啥生气嘞？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a> 说到路怒，那可是太有共鸣了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a> 最该生气的就是这个b班吧！但没想到。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 吵架就是越吵越想打架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2904">48:24</a> 愤怒有啥好处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 父母那一辈愤怒的点不太一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3778">1:02:58</a> 生这个气干啥！后悔！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4098">1:08:18</a> 地球生过最大的气导致进了3次公安局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4403">1:13:23</a> 积累的愤怒可能变成冷静了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4628">1:17:08</a> 多种方法分享，帮你解决愤怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4982">1:23:02</a> 情绪管理也是很重要滴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5320">1:28:40</a> 其实生活中让你生气的人都是NPC</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《生气》- 孙瑄阳Xtina</span></p><span></span><p><span>《莫生气》- 陈柯宇</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llivbysYYP8AAMCMxwC4PuLWeITk.m4a" length="140276525" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsEPSmXQdIC8HpV7PKepc4qN5Mm8.png"/>
